// HISTORY

// Arachnos Rising
"RecluseHistory1" "The former corrupt government of the Rogue Isles had a reserve force on this island. Lord Recluse and his glorious revolution would not be denied, however. The holdouts were crushed nearly to the man. A city was built upon their bones, and eventually became the paradise known as St. Martial."


